after:
The strip sits inside a frame.

```css
.frame {
  width: 300px;
}
.strip {
  width: calc(100% - 40px);
  height: 20px;
  background: teal;
}
```

The parentheses hold the calculation. For this frame, the strip asks for 300 − 40 = 260 pixels. Its height and color make it easy to see.
